{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rensu-e-o064","title":"或劝杜畿宜须大兵，杜畿自陈单车直往、以计縻固之策","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-a13fb77b1993b8f640fd","label":"正文","text":"或劝杜畿宜须大兵，杜畿自陈单车直往、以计縻固之策","evidence":["rensu-q-b05f74775f00a7994b85"]},{"id":"rensu-a-45b9ce8c35e633790ab7","label":"正文","text":"杜畿遂诡道从郖津渡河","evidence":["rensu-q-f3a6e24f1fd948be6c18"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c08493af34d82671aff2","label":"正文","text":"范先欲杀杜畿以威众、观其去就，于门下斩杀主簿以下三十余人","evidence":["rensu-q-839df869e15e162a3b26"]},{"id":"rensu-a-b65abc8230bca9d6a2ae","label":"正文","text":"杜畿举动自若，卫固以杀之无损、制之在我，遂奉杜畿","evidence":["rensu-q-7541709a6f05cc964694"]},{"id":"rensu-a-327664f4306ddc37696f","label":"裴注·傅子","text":"范先云\"既欲为虎而恶食人肉，失所以为虎矣。今不杀，必为后患\"（劝杀杜畿之语）","evidence":["rensu-q-3e9e2be4b517ea19ca24"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0020","role":"决策自往者；诡道渡河者；欲加威吓之对象；被奉而自若者；所议当杀之对象","evidence":["rensu-q-b05f74775f00a7994b85","rensu-q-f3a6e24f1fd948be6c18","rensu-q-839df869e15e162a3b26","rensu-q-7541709a6f05cc964694","rensu-q-3e9e2be4b517ea19ca24"]},{"person":"zhonghua-p0067","role":"斩杀者；进言者","evidence":["rensu-q-839df869e15e162a3b26","rensu-q-3e9e2be4b517ea19ca24"]},{"person":"zhonghua-p0022","role":"决意奉迎者","evidence":["rensu-q-7541709a6f05cc964694"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-b05f74775f00a7994b85","rensu-q-f3a6e24f1fd948be6c18","rensu-q-839df869e15e162a3b26","rensu-q-7541709a6f05cc964694","rensu-q-3e9e2be4b517ea19ca24"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-b05f74775f00a7994b85","source_order":[16,86,33],"order":3410}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0020","name":"杜畿","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhonghua-p0022","name":"卫固","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhonghua-p0067","name":"范先","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-3e9e2be4b517ea19ca24","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-37919d79c597dc5a42a8","layer":"pei","quote":"先云：‘既欲为虎而恶食人肉，失所以为虎矣。今不杀，必为后患","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-75a1f9b90c35ca4848e9","start":10,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-7541709a6f05cc964694","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"畿举动自若。于是固曰：“杀之无损，徒有恶名；且制之在我。”遂奉之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":252,"end":284,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-839df869e15e162a3b26","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"范先欲杀畿以威众，﹝二﹞且观畿去就〖8〗，于门下斩杀主簿以下三十余人","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":217,"end":251,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-b05f74775f00a7994b85","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"或谓畿曰：“宜须大兵〖2〗。”畿曰：“河东有三万户，非皆欲为乱也。今兵迫之急，欲为善者无主，必惧而听于固；固等势专〖3〗，必以死战。讨之不胜，四邻应之，天下之变未息也；讨之而胜，是残一郡之民也。且固等未显绝王命〖4〗，外以请故君为名〖5〗，必不害新君〖6〗。吾单车直往，出其不意；固为人多计而无断，必伪受吾。吾得居郡一月，以计縻之，足矣","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":33,"end":201,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-f3a6e24f1fd948be6c18","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"遂诡道从郖津度","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":203,"end":210,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
